  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "cti-bench",
  "identifier": "10.57967/hf/2506",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for CTIBench\n\t\n\n\n\nA set of benchmark tasks designed to evaluate large language models (LLMs) on cyber threat intelligence (CTI) tasks.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Details\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\n\n\nCTIBench is a comprehensive suite of benchmark tasks and datasets designed to evaluate LLMs in the field of CTI.\nComponents:\n\nCTI-MCQ: A knowledge evaluation dataset with multiple-choice questions to assess the LLMs' understanding of CTI standards, threats, detection strategies\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/AI4Sec/cti-bench.",
  "alternateName": [
    "AI4Sec/cti-bench",
    "CTIBench"
  ],
